WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.455
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:12.725 --> 00:15.995
(Jung Yong Hwa)

3
00:16.065 --> 00:19.065
(Hong Seung Hee)

4
00:19.135 --> 00:22.235
(Lee Yi Kyung)

5
00:23.505 --> 00:25.375
(Park Yu Na)

6
00:36.715 --> 00:39.955
(Oh! My Guard)

7
00:40.025 --> 00:41.525
(This drama is a work of fiction.)

8
00:41.585 --> 00:43.155
(Also, children and animals were filmed under production guidelines.)

9
00:50.165 --> 00:51.735
We have received the unfortunate news...

10
00:51.795 --> 00:55.605
that actor Choi Gu is currently suffering from dementia.

11
00:55.665 --> 00:58.205
Actor Choi Gu debuted in 1993...

12
00:58.275 --> 01:01.005
through the Korean Broadcasting TV Literature Theater,

13
01:01.075 --> 01:04.245
and for about 30 years, he has been actively acting...

14
01:04.315 --> 01:06.515
across both television and theater stages.

15
01:07.645 --> 01:11.415
After his wife passed away from a chronic illness in 2019,

16
01:11.485 --> 01:13.855
and recently losing his only daughter,

17
01:13.925 --> 01:17.025
it appears that his condition has rapidly deteriorated.

18
01:17.095 --> 01:20.795
We here at Scoop TV also wish Choi Gu a speedy recovery.

19
01:21.995 --> 01:25.665
Moving on to our next story. Singer A has been booked...

20
01:25.735 --> 01:26.735
for habitual illegal gambling,

21
01:26.805 --> 01:29.535
drawing global attention.

22
01:29.605 --> 01:33.075
From around July 2017 to this past February,

23
01:33.075 --> 01:34.275
Singer A gambled 30 times...

24
01:34.275 --> 01:36.715
- with around one million dollars... - What was that just now?

25
01:37.115 --> 01:39.685
(Episode 6)

26
01:39.685 --> 01:40.915
What was what?

27
01:40.985 --> 01:42.955
You know, like,

28
01:43.015 --> 01:46.385
pulling me in, hugging me, pressing down on my head...

29
01:50.495 --> 01:51.525
Do not tell me...

30
01:55.025 --> 01:56.835
You were worried I would eat it all by myself,

31
01:56.895 --> 01:57.995
so you followed me out here?

32
02:00.735 --> 02:04.805
Oh, looking at your shoes, that is exactly it.

33
02:04.875 --> 02:07.745
You must have been in a huge rush. How petty.

34
02:08.745 --> 02:10.375
What? Petty?

35
02:12.445 --> 02:16.355
Take that back. No, apologize. Who are you calling petty?

36
02:16.415 --> 02:19.485
My entire life, I have only ever heard...

37
02:19.555 --> 02:23.225
that I am bold and fearless. Apologize.

38
02:23.295 --> 02:27.525
Oh, is that so. Here you go. Sorry.

39
02:27.595 --> 02:29.265
Is that an apology?

40
02:29.325 --> 02:31.835
- An apology like that, I will... - I refuse...

41
02:33.535 --> 02:35.105
- your refusal. - Look at you.

42
02:35.105 --> 02:37.375
You must have learned how to apologize with your toes.

43
02:38.605 --> 02:42.305
You need a really good scolding to come to your senses.

44
02:42.375 --> 02:43.875
My thoughts exactly. Right back at you.

45
02:45.745 --> 02:46.945
Right back at you, too.

46
02:48.685 --> 02:51.415
She identifies herself with a drama character,

47
02:51.485 --> 02:54.655
and she cannot remember anything about her real self in reality?

48
02:54.755 --> 02:55.825
(A Few Days Ago)

49
02:55.885 --> 02:58.225
I would say it is a bit different from amnesia.

50
02:58.295 --> 03:01.395
It is a kind of psychological self-defense mechanism.

51
03:01.465 --> 03:02.995
If someone like that is around me,

52
03:03.065 --> 03:06.065
- would I be in a lot of danger? - Well.

53
03:06.135 --> 03:08.365
The person themselves would be in more danger.

54
03:08.435 --> 03:11.005
If they are forced to face reality too suddenly...

55
03:13.105 --> 03:16.045
It would be like a ticking time bomb going off.

56
03:16.105 --> 03:18.375
It is best to let them realize it slowly on their own...

57
03:18.375 --> 03:22.045
so their self-defense mechanism does not collapse all at once.

58
03:22.115 --> 03:24.355
Otherwise, their mind will obviously become...

59
03:24.415 --> 03:25.615
a complete mess,

60
03:25.685 --> 03:28.025
and I am not sure how much of that shock...

61
03:28.085 --> 03:29.185
the brain can handle...

62
03:31.795 --> 03:33.795
To be more precise,

63
03:33.865 --> 03:36.025
we will need to do a brain scan...

64
03:37.965 --> 03:39.265
But who?

65
03:47.305 --> 03:48.805
How many cavities do you have?

66
03:50.515 --> 03:52.445
I run a pawnshop.

67
03:53.485 --> 03:54.885
I accept gold teeth.

68
03:57.855 --> 03:59.515
Except for the gold teeth,

69
04:01.685 --> 04:04.025
I will chew you all up.

70
04:10.535 --> 04:11.535
That is too much, too much.

71
04:19.235 --> 04:22.475
But why were you so angry earlier?

72
04:23.775 --> 04:26.075
Who is the one filled with anger these days?

73
04:32.255 --> 04:33.285
You.

74
04:35.855 --> 04:36.955
You do not trust me, do you?

75
04:40.595 --> 04:42.625
You think just having me...

76
04:42.695 --> 04:44.795
- is not enough, right? - What are you talking about?

77
04:45.995 --> 04:47.035
Speak so I can understand.

78
04:47.105 --> 04:51.475
He did not look like he had soft muscles or weak bones.

79
04:51.535 --> 04:53.405
Just by looking at him.

80
04:53.475 --> 04:54.675
What, weak...

81
04:56.845 --> 04:57.845
Who?

82
05:04.355 --> 05:05.485
Am I someone...

83
05:06.985 --> 05:08.255
you do not need?

84
05:18.865 --> 05:19.865
Do not follow me.

85
05:24.005 --> 05:26.005
What do you mean, do not follow you?

86
05:26.075 --> 05:27.145
It is my house.

87
05:30.415 --> 05:32.475
What do you mean? Take down the article?

88
05:36.315 --> 05:37.715
He lost his wife.

89
05:39.925 --> 05:40.955
And recently,

90
05:42.155 --> 05:43.695
even his only daughter...

91
05:46.965 --> 05:49.565
They say his dementia worsened from the shock.

92
05:49.625 --> 05:51.065
The problem is that even now,

93
05:51.135 --> 05:53.235
he is going back and forth, and it is a mess.

94
05:53.305 --> 05:56.835
If he receives any more shock, he will be in real trouble.

95
06:00.305 --> 06:02.105
I did not know there was such a story.

96
06:05.275 --> 06:07.245
Still, because they worked on a drama together,

97
06:07.315 --> 06:09.115
our Tae Bong is helping him out.

98
06:14.155 --> 06:15.425
Um Tae Bong is loyal.

99
06:22.565 --> 06:24.295
I will have to take down the exclusive article about Choi Gu.

100
06:25.435 --> 06:27.535
The reporting was wrong.

101
06:27.605 --> 06:30.275
Yes, I will write a letter of apology.

102
06:30.335 --> 06:31.505
Sir...

103
06:33.575 --> 06:35.305
I will post that in the reporters' group chat.

104
06:35.375 --> 06:36.515
So that other places cannot cover it either.

105
06:43.385 --> 06:45.185
The issue with him has been well resolved.

106
06:47.485 --> 06:48.525
That is a relief.

107
06:53.055 --> 06:54.325
This is...

108
06:54.325 --> 06:56.095
not a sound coming from my mouth.

109
06:57.595 --> 06:58.765
It is a sound coming from my fist.

110
07:00.005 --> 07:01.735
Again...

111
07:01.805 --> 07:03.575
I can go right back to how I was.

112
07:03.635 --> 07:06.405
I came as the junior stylist.

113
07:11.945 --> 07:14.045
He really thinks I am not enough, that is what it is.

114
07:16.785 --> 07:17.785
Or,

115
07:19.755 --> 07:21.325
he just does not find me reliable anymore.

116
07:22.625 --> 07:25.195
That is right, that is it.

117
07:25.255 --> 07:27.165
Okay, I admit it.

118
07:27.225 --> 07:29.795
That I am not as agile as before,

119
07:29.865 --> 07:31.935
and that I cannot even kick properly.

120
07:31.995 --> 07:35.905
I admit all of that.

121
07:35.965 --> 07:39.075
- One. - No way. I really feel like...

122
07:39.135 --> 07:40.505
I am going to die, Father.

123
07:40.575 --> 07:42.605
- Did you count that right? - One is correct.

124
07:45.445 --> 07:49.645
Anyway, Um Tae Bong, you are the one person...

125
07:49.715 --> 07:53.755
- I will definitely protect. - One.

126
07:53.825 --> 07:55.285
Why is it one again?

127
08:02.425 --> 08:04.365
So she is angry?

128
08:04.435 --> 08:06.705
- One. - So that...

129
08:06.765 --> 08:08.635
- Three. - she could be someone I need?

130
08:12.035 --> 08:13.805
I need to pee.

131
08:17.015 --> 08:18.415
That young lady...

132
08:19.415 --> 08:23.115
looks really nice when she smiles. Right? Tae Bong.

133
08:25.085 --> 08:26.085
Right.

134
08:29.225 --> 08:30.225
Sir...

135
08:32.525 --> 08:33.625
Sir?

136
08:37.065 --> 08:40.935
I really need to pee. Oh, it is urgent.

137
08:41.005 --> 08:42.305
It is urgent.

138
08:46.775 --> 08:47.805
Sir...

139
08:49.545 --> 08:51.015
Using the new car launch as an excuse,

140
08:51.075 --> 08:52.075
the shareholders' meeting was delayed...

141
08:52.145 --> 08:53.845
is spreading as a rumor.

142
08:53.915 --> 08:55.615
Since it directly affects the stock price,

143
08:55.685 --> 08:56.885
if it is delayed again,

144
08:56.955 --> 09:00.185
the shareholders will not just sit back.

145
09:00.255 --> 09:02.355
Oh, of course, the new car line is getting a good response,

146
09:02.425 --> 09:04.655
so the stock price has been rising more than before.

147
09:04.725 --> 09:06.595
Still, to put the false rumors to rest,

148
09:06.665 --> 09:08.265
do we not need to do something?

149
09:08.325 --> 09:09.325
False rumors?

150
09:09.395 --> 09:11.635
The rumors about the veiled heiress.

151
09:17.935 --> 09:19.135
The date for the shareholders' meeting will be...

152
09:19.205 --> 09:20.405
rescheduled soon.

153
09:24.245 --> 09:26.685
Wow, how experienced is this guy?

154
09:26.745 --> 09:29.285
The stock price went up with the new car launch,

155
09:29.345 --> 09:31.615
so he created a justification to increase...

156
09:31.685 --> 09:33.425
the votes for his reappointment at the shareholders' meeting.

157
09:33.485 --> 09:36.185
Do you know who is more anxious than the old tiger?

158
09:38.255 --> 09:42.195
- The fox with many secrets. - Oh, please be careful.

159
09:42.265 --> 09:44.035
Seeing how he turned the once-powerful Chairman Wang...

160
09:44.095 --> 09:47.705
into a toothless tiger and forced him to step down,

161
09:47.765 --> 09:49.835
how scary of a person is he?

162
09:50.905 --> 09:54.605
- Toothless. - No, more importantly, earlier,

163
09:54.675 --> 09:58.445
that rumor about the heiress. I have not heard it.

164
09:58.515 --> 09:59.515
Was there such a thing?

165
09:59.575 --> 10:01.785
If there is not one, we can just make one.

166
10:01.845 --> 10:02.845
Excuse me?

167
10:02.915 --> 10:05.485
That fox is definitely hiding something.

168
10:05.555 --> 10:07.585
A secret we do not know yet.

169
10:07.655 --> 10:09.225
A secret?

170
10:09.285 --> 10:10.555
Is there any secret...

171
10:10.625 --> 10:11.725
that does not come to light in this world?

172
10:13.155 --> 10:15.425
Does it not feel like something very interesting...

173
10:15.495 --> 10:16.495
is going to happen?

174
10:18.065 --> 10:22.035
When the heiress was mentioned, his eyes said it all.

175
10:24.735 --> 10:26.035
Eyes?

176
10:26.105 --> 10:29.375
When it comes to intimidating eyes, our chairman is on another level.

177
10:29.445 --> 10:32.875
Last time in the lobby, I made eye contact with him once,

178
10:32.945 --> 10:34.215
and I almost wet myself.

179
10:36.185 --> 10:38.455
Is that why the founder, Chairman Wang, disliked him?

180
10:38.515 --> 10:40.755
Because of those intimidating eyes.

181
10:40.825 --> 10:42.655
I heard he strongly opposed the marriage because of that.

182
10:42.725 --> 10:45.895
That is why he worked himself to death.

183
10:45.955 --> 10:47.865
To look good to his father-in-law. Right?

184
10:47.925 --> 10:50.565
Honestly, our company growing this much...

185
10:50.635 --> 10:52.865
is all thanks to the current Chairman Oh.

186
10:52.935 --> 10:54.365
Even if she is his own daughter,

187
10:54.435 --> 10:56.035
if the company is taken right out from under him,

188
10:56.105 --> 10:57.875
would he be pissed off or not?

189
10:57.935 --> 11:00.045
- He would be. - Exactly.

190
11:00.105 --> 11:02.345
This is so annoying. What now?

191
11:02.405 --> 11:05.245
It splashed all over my clothes. Pay for my dry cleaning.

192
11:05.315 --> 11:07.615
Oh, it is just a little bit of water.

193
11:08.685 --> 11:10.885
Last week, you said you burned the roof of your mouth...

194
11:10.955 --> 11:13.425
and asked for medical bills. So annoying.

195
11:13.485 --> 11:16.155
She is a repeat offender. She is very famous for it.

196
11:16.225 --> 11:17.925
But if our heiress...

197
11:17.995 --> 11:20.565
is a pain like her, we are in big trouble.

198
11:27.865 --> 11:29.065
Oh, I will...

199
11:29.135 --> 11:30.305
- Thank you. - Thank you.

200
11:31.305 --> 11:32.305
(Lunch Special Discount Event)

201
11:33.605 --> 11:35.405
- Let's go. - Please go ahead.

202
11:45.855 --> 11:46.855
Oh my.

203
11:48.985 --> 11:50.825
What did you just do to me?

204
11:54.295 --> 11:55.695
I do not think we even touched.

205
11:55.765 --> 11:58.095
Then why is this on the floor?

206
12:11.545 --> 12:13.115
Come on, do something about it.

207
12:15.385 --> 12:16.385
Why should I?

208
12:17.685 --> 12:18.815
Are you asking because you do not know?

209
12:18.885 --> 12:20.785
Everyone is recognizing me right now.

210
12:23.085 --> 12:26.195
Since you are so famous, are you billing me right now?

211
12:26.255 --> 12:28.025
What exactly are you billing me for in this situation?

212
12:28.095 --> 12:31.665
What are you talking about? Seriously, do something about this.

213
12:50.555 --> 12:53.115
The more I think about it, the less it's my issue.

214
12:53.185 --> 12:55.255
And why the sunglasses indoors?

215
13:03.965 --> 13:07.305
That is my business. What a total freak.

216
13:08.535 --> 13:09.805
Could he be an anti-fan?

217
13:15.205 --> 13:16.205
What is going on?

218
13:16.275 --> 13:18.575
You are actually volunteering to work out.

219
13:18.645 --> 13:19.945
Did you bring a camera crew or something?

220
13:21.245 --> 13:24.185
When you are not around to protect me from the stalker,

221
13:24.255 --> 13:26.685
- I have to protect my own body. - You have Hong Du.

222
13:27.955 --> 13:29.055
I heard she is your secret bodyguard.

223
13:29.125 --> 13:31.895
- Su Dong told me. - Gosh, that blabbermouth.

224
13:31.955 --> 13:33.695
And what happened at the store last time.

225
13:33.765 --> 13:35.225
Did you two already know each other?

226
13:35.295 --> 13:38.365
It is complicated. A little help?

227
13:38.435 --> 13:39.495
- Here. - Oh, man.

228
13:41.305 --> 13:43.265
How complicated could it be...

229
13:43.335 --> 13:46.075
that you even lied to Hong Du about me being a stylist?

230
13:49.505 --> 13:51.215
Did she...

231
13:51.275 --> 13:52.945
catch you doing something wrong?

232
13:57.355 --> 13:59.155
What?

233
13:59.215 --> 14:01.525
Running, it is all about running.

234
14:01.585 --> 14:03.895
Whether it is a fan or a stalker,

235
14:03.955 --> 14:06.125
if you face a dangerous situation,

236
14:06.195 --> 14:08.395
you just have to run away.

237
14:08.465 --> 14:10.265
What does she have on you?

238
14:20.135 --> 14:21.645
- You punk. - Hey, let go.

239
14:21.705 --> 14:23.275
I have been going easy on you lately...

240
14:23.345 --> 14:25.815
Hey, are you going to talk? Are you really not going to talk?

241
14:25.875 --> 14:27.615
What was that about earlier? Gosh.

242
14:28.645 --> 14:30.045
Tap.

243
14:35.155 --> 14:36.185
When are you going to tell me?

244
14:39.625 --> 14:41.325
Idiot.

245
14:41.395 --> 14:43.965
Do you think I'm blind? That Hong Du is a fake.

246
14:46.295 --> 14:49.135
You think a swordsman wouldn't recognize another swordsman?

247
14:49.205 --> 14:51.335
Hong Du is obviously not one of us.

248
14:52.905 --> 14:54.205
You're like a ghost.

249
14:55.775 --> 14:59.575
When you accepted Hong Du as your bodyguard, well,

250
14:59.645 --> 15:02.345
you must have had a good reason. But...

251
15:03.445 --> 15:04.915
This isn't right.

252
15:04.985 --> 15:07.625
You're in danger too. And I can't always be by your side.

253
15:28.205 --> 15:30.745
- Since when have you been here? - I just got here.

254
15:30.815 --> 15:32.415
CEO Park told me you were here.

255
15:34.315 --> 15:35.815
All alone without even telling me?

256
15:35.885 --> 15:37.555
Just...

257
15:37.615 --> 15:39.715
I thought you were spending time with your father.

258
15:40.725 --> 15:41.755
Are you avoiding me?

259
15:42.925 --> 15:44.095
Me?

260
15:44.855 --> 15:46.055
No.

261
15:46.125 --> 15:47.125
Look.

262
15:48.125 --> 15:50.365
You're not even making eye contact right now.

263
15:50.435 --> 15:52.735
I never look at anyone for more than three seconds.

264
15:52.795 --> 15:54.235
I'm afraid I'll blind them.

265
15:57.835 --> 15:59.235
Do you really not need me?

266
16:00.545 --> 16:02.675
The bodyguard who protects you, you don't need me anymore...

267
16:03.775 --> 16:05.675
You should take it easy too.

268
16:05.745 --> 16:08.015
Don't risk your life for me.

269
16:16.625 --> 16:17.855
What does that mean?

270
16:19.295 --> 16:20.865
That's...

271
16:20.925 --> 16:22.025
my job.

272
16:38.545 --> 16:41.315
- So I'm Tae Bong's... - I know.

273
16:41.385 --> 16:44.115
Um Tae Bong didn't trust me enough, so he called you.

274
16:44.185 --> 16:47.355
Then please take good care of Um Tae Bong.

275
16:51.655 --> 16:52.655
Excuse me...

276
16:53.765 --> 16:56.125
I need to catch this stalker or something.

277
17:01.035 --> 17:03.875
(Filming With Tae Bong)

278
17:10.245 --> 17:11.475
Where have you been?

279
17:11.545 --> 17:13.415
I made Tae Bong exercise a bit.

280
17:13.475 --> 17:16.545
Good job. If you help Tae Bong,

281
17:16.615 --> 17:18.455
I can relax too.

282
17:18.515 --> 17:19.555
What's this?

283
17:20.885 --> 17:22.585
Letters from that stalker.

284
17:22.655 --> 17:24.955
Without Tae Bong knowing, I'm going to catch this jerk.

285
17:27.425 --> 17:29.025
There are no customers.

286
17:29.095 --> 17:31.965
Yes. We had a whole war earlier,

287
17:32.035 --> 17:33.295
and now there's one person...

288
17:39.135 --> 17:41.375
When did they leave? That customer is strange.

289
17:41.445 --> 17:43.175
He just left last time too.

290
17:49.115 --> 17:52.055
Are you looking for them, or are you intentionally not looking?

291
17:52.115 --> 17:55.385
I have to move quietly, so it's just taking some time.

292
17:55.455 --> 17:56.455
More importantly,

293
17:57.795 --> 17:59.525
I want to know how you feel, Chairman.

294
18:02.895 --> 18:04.335
Are you looking for her...

295
18:04.395 --> 18:06.235
to get a memorandum of renunciation of management rights...

296
18:06.295 --> 18:07.535
before the shareholders' meeting, or...

297
18:09.305 --> 18:10.735
is it because you want to be a father to her...

298
18:10.805 --> 18:14.145
- even now? - Even if she comes back,

299
18:14.205 --> 18:15.245
do you think...

300
18:16.705 --> 18:19.215
she could become someone who fits in at the company?

301
18:24.985 --> 18:27.785
You've watched her closer than anyone,

302
18:27.855 --> 18:29.625
so you'd know the answer better than me.

303
18:31.695 --> 18:33.425
What if...

304
18:33.495 --> 18:35.065
the young lady is changing?

305
18:39.635 --> 18:41.265
Are you hiding something from me?

306
18:47.675 --> 18:48.675
Come in.

307
18:57.955 --> 18:59.785
Right, you have something to report?

308
19:03.555 --> 19:06.055
I apologize. It wasn't the young lady.

309
19:07.665 --> 19:08.665
What?

310
19:28.385 --> 19:29.585
The young lady's whereabouts are still...

311
19:33.655 --> 19:34.655
Excuse me...

312
19:42.465 --> 19:44.965
Did you happen to find the person you were looking for?

313
19:48.465 --> 19:50.065
I'm Han Jung Woo from the Strategic Planning Team.

314
19:51.235 --> 19:55.045
I happened to overhear you in the chairman's office last time.

315
19:55.105 --> 19:56.905
I apologize.

316
19:56.975 --> 19:58.315
You must have misheard.

317
20:00.415 --> 20:01.415
I don't think so.

318
20:02.515 --> 20:04.285
I definitely heard it then.

319
20:06.415 --> 20:09.155
No. You misheard.

320
20:13.855 --> 20:16.665
If you make such a scary face,

321
20:16.725 --> 20:19.395
people might think you're threatening me right now.

322
20:21.235 --> 20:23.205
This makes me even more curious.

323
20:29.245 --> 20:31.575
You must have misunderstood something.

324
20:31.645 --> 20:33.175
- What I mean is... - Actually...

325
20:34.285 --> 20:36.745
A car accident from a long time ago, I saw an article about it.

326
20:38.485 --> 20:39.585
(At the accident scene involving victim Wang Hui Yeon)

327
20:39.655 --> 20:41.025
(A car keychain was found.)

328
20:41.085 --> 20:42.085
(It did not seem to belong to her.)

329
20:42.155 --> 20:43.525
(No other occupants were reported.)

330
20:47.325 --> 20:48.595
Is it because of that?

331
20:52.135 --> 20:54.135
I got more curious about that person.

332
20:57.305 --> 20:58.305
That person?

333
20:59.305 --> 21:00.305
Yes.

334
21:01.145 --> 21:02.145
That person.

335
21:08.515 --> 21:10.345
It's late.

336
21:10.415 --> 21:11.415
I'll be going then.

337
21:17.255 --> 21:19.555
Han Jung Woo from the Strategic Planning Team.

338
21:25.835 --> 21:28.865
Yes, Chairman. I found out where she is.

339
21:28.935 --> 21:30.005
Yes, I'm heading up now.

340
21:31.905 --> 21:32.935
Secretary Kim Ji An.

341
21:37.445 --> 21:40.015
- The reason you wanted to see me... - You should know.

342
21:41.185 --> 21:42.545
I was just...

343
21:42.615 --> 21:45.385
- doing what the chairman ordered... - You also did things...

344
21:45.455 --> 21:48.755
the chairman didn't order. I know you dug into my background.

345
21:48.825 --> 21:50.955
Even the time before I came to the chairman's house.

346
21:52.725 --> 21:53.725
Yes.

347
21:55.725 --> 21:58.235
Then you'll understand quickly.

348
21:58.295 --> 22:01.905
Do the job the chairman ordered.

349
22:01.965 --> 22:03.065
Instead,

350
22:03.135 --> 22:05.105
the answer you report to the chairman...

351
22:05.175 --> 22:06.835
is already decided.

352
22:13.415 --> 22:15.045
I thought I was going to suffocate.

353
22:20.925 --> 22:21.925
Yes.

354
22:23.385 --> 22:25.355
It is today, right? The meeting with Um Tae Bong.

355
22:36.305 --> 22:38.005
With that ribbon around your neck today,

356
22:38.075 --> 22:40.845
you look exactly like a prince. Why did you tie it like a butterfly?

357
22:42.175 --> 22:43.175
What about Dong Seok?

358
22:43.245 --> 22:44.645
He said he had something to look into,

359
22:44.715 --> 22:46.145
so he cannot make it today.

360
22:46.215 --> 22:49.085
Are you really not taking Hong Du with you?

361
22:49.145 --> 22:50.445
She is a fake.

362
22:50.515 --> 22:53.355
Her name, her bodyguard skills, all fake.

363
22:53.415 --> 22:56.685
We managed to get by until now, but we cannot do this anymore.

364
22:58.255 --> 22:59.625
It is too dangerous for me.

365
22:59.695 --> 23:01.325
Right, you have a point,

366
23:01.395 --> 23:03.095
but if we are going to put on a Truman Show anyway...

367
23:05.065 --> 23:06.995
Hong Du, you were at home.

368
23:07.065 --> 23:09.205
- Where is Mr. Choi? - He is sleeping.

369
23:09.265 --> 23:10.905
I see.

370
23:10.975 --> 23:13.275
Thank you for always taking care of my father.

371
23:13.335 --> 23:16.105
No, I am the one who is always thankful.

372
23:18.615 --> 23:20.645
But do I really not need to go with you?

373
23:23.185 --> 23:25.785
Yes. CEO Park is going with me.

374
23:27.155 --> 23:28.985
Still.

375
23:29.055 --> 23:30.825
If you go, you will just get in the...

376
23:34.425 --> 23:36.125
Anyway,

377
23:36.195 --> 23:37.965
stay home.

378
23:38.035 --> 23:39.135
Do not wander around.

379
23:49.405 --> 23:50.475
He is avoiding me again.

380
23:52.645 --> 23:54.045
This is not why I came here.

381
23:56.645 --> 23:58.255
When I woke up in the hospital,

382
23:59.855 --> 24:01.255
I should not have looked for him.

383
24:03.185 --> 24:04.195
It is Um Tae Bong.

384
24:07.525 --> 24:09.025
Yes.

385
24:09.095 --> 24:10.295
Yes, understood.

386
24:10.365 --> 24:11.935
Sorry, they said they will be right down.

387
24:11.995 --> 24:13.065
They asked us to wait here for a moment.

388
24:14.165 --> 24:16.035
Cha Hong Du.

389
24:16.105 --> 24:18.005
Whatever that woman's real name is,

390
24:19.075 --> 24:21.545
do you really not know? Her true identity?

391
24:21.605 --> 24:23.105
I do not know.

392
24:23.175 --> 24:24.175
I swear, I have no idea.

393
24:24.245 --> 24:26.175
She does not even know herself, so how would I know?

394
24:28.615 --> 24:31.215
I would say it is a bit different from amnesia.

395
24:31.285 --> 24:34.785
It is a kind of psychological self-defense mechanism.

396
24:36.855 --> 24:39.255
If it is self-defense,

397
24:39.325 --> 24:42.095
that means her life must have been really hard, right?

398
24:43.265 --> 24:44.395
Who knows.

399
24:44.465 --> 24:45.735
Man, that Nam Goong, whatever his name is,

400
24:45.795 --> 24:46.965
he is too tight-lipped.

401
24:48.505 --> 24:49.505
Nam...

402
24:49.565 --> 24:50.935
Nam Goong who?

403
24:52.035 --> 24:55.705
What? Nam? Why? Who?

404
24:55.775 --> 24:57.615
Hold on.

405
24:57.675 --> 24:59.945
Yes, hello? Yes.

406
25:00.015 --> 25:02.615
Now that you mention it, yes, it was today, right?

407
25:02.685 --> 25:04.415
Oh, understood, I will be right there.

408
25:04.485 --> 25:06.485
Yes. Hey, what should we do?

409
25:06.555 --> 25:07.955
I forgot about my meeting with the film company.

410
25:08.025 --> 25:09.625
Should I call Su Dong at least?

411
25:09.685 --> 25:11.895
Look, there are so many people here.

412
25:11.955 --> 25:13.895
Do not worry, nothing dangerous will happen.

413
25:13.955 --> 25:14.965
Not that.

414
25:15.025 --> 25:16.595
I am worried you will get into another power struggle...

415
25:16.665 --> 25:17.865
with the director here like last time.

416
25:17.935 --> 25:19.935
Why did you squeeze his hand so hard during the handshake?

417
25:19.995 --> 25:21.535
That is because...

418
25:21.605 --> 25:23.735
I have been working out intensely lately.

419
25:23.805 --> 25:25.905
Working out, my foot. Is breathing considered a workout?

420
25:25.975 --> 25:28.275
It was so pathetic to watch. He basically toyed with you.

421
25:28.345 --> 25:30.105
What? No, he did not.

422
25:30.175 --> 25:31.175
You looked like you were struggling.

423
25:31.245 --> 25:33.915
- I really was not. - Seriously?

424
25:33.975 --> 25:35.385
Actor Um Tae Bong.

425
25:39.255 --> 25:41.085
I apologize, but I have urgent business to attend to right now.

426
25:41.155 --> 25:42.185
Please take good care of him.

427
25:58.605 --> 26:03.745
Under no circumstances are you allowed in my room.

428
26:03.805 --> 26:07.815
Oh, right. I will not go in. Who said I was curious anyway?

429
26:07.885 --> 26:08.985
I mean, it is just a room...

430
26:09.045 --> 26:11.255
How different could it be? What?

431
26:11.315 --> 26:12.655
Just because I grabbed the doorknob like this,

432
26:12.715 --> 26:13.955
does it mean I will turn it?

433
26:14.015 --> 26:15.755
And if I turn it, does it mean I will go in?

434
26:17.655 --> 26:20.965
Oh my, I guess I came in. Into this room.

435
26:24.025 --> 26:26.565
Why is this room as big as a playground?

436
26:32.375 --> 26:34.235
That look in your eyes.

437
26:34.305 --> 26:37.845
Sneaking into a room when the owner is not here,

438
26:37.915 --> 26:41.285
asking me what on earth I am doing, that is the look you are giving me.

439
26:41.345 --> 26:43.045
But...

440
26:43.115 --> 26:45.785
you do not seem unfamiliar.

441
26:56.865 --> 26:59.595
He sleeps alone, but the bed is huge.

442
26:59.665 --> 27:02.165
Does he think he is the pioneer of luxury and waste?

443
27:04.105 --> 27:08.175
Anyway, this is really nice.

444
27:12.215 --> 27:13.475
This coziness.

445
27:16.385 --> 27:18.215
Why does it feel so familiar?

446
27:19.585 --> 27:23.485
It is like falling asleep like this...

447
27:26.255 --> 27:28.595
And so...

448
27:28.665 --> 27:31.065
feeling incredibly lonely...

449
27:33.465 --> 27:35.105
Welcome back, Chairman.

450
27:35.165 --> 27:40.075
- Like I was always alone... - The young lady is not asleep yet.

451
27:41.205 --> 27:42.345
I will see her later.

452
27:45.345 --> 27:46.575
What is this?

453
27:47.675 --> 27:49.515
Is there an underground water vein flowing under the bed or something?

454
27:49.585 --> 27:52.985
No, why are these strange words suddenly coming to mind?

455
27:54.955 --> 27:59.055
Could this be Um Tae Bong's curse?

456
28:06.795 --> 28:10.065
- Hello? - I just got a call from the CEO,

457
28:10.135 --> 28:11.705
telling me to hurry and join his meeting.

458
28:14.075 --> 28:15.845
But I cannot go.

459
28:15.905 --> 28:17.845
I am here at the broadcasting station...

460
28:17.915 --> 28:19.245
to coordinate the filming schedule with the AD.

461
28:19.315 --> 28:21.345
You are the bodyguard, not me.

462
28:24.285 --> 28:25.355
Look at this, look at this.

463
28:25.415 --> 28:28.655
Cha Hong Du is the only one slacking off again today, just her.

464
28:28.725 --> 28:30.025
I am certain...

465
28:30.085 --> 28:31.725
he is being blackmailed by her with some weakness.

466
28:31.795 --> 28:34.025
- Weakness? - Actually...

467
28:35.765 --> 28:37.025
I heard something.

468
28:40.695 --> 28:43.535
Your life as a romance actor is dead.

469
28:43.605 --> 28:45.335
And that is...

470
28:45.405 --> 28:47.675
a fatal flaw as a man, too.

471
28:47.735 --> 28:48.745
Flaw?

472
28:51.045 --> 28:52.045
When I heard that,

473
28:52.115 --> 28:54.845
I should have used that weakness against him myself.

474
28:54.915 --> 28:57.585
Did you not say love cannot just move on?

475
28:57.645 --> 28:59.455
I thought you had become a decent person for a second.

476
29:03.755 --> 29:07.125
I am doing this because of love, too.

477
29:07.195 --> 29:09.025
Cha Hong Du caught his weakness,

478
29:09.095 --> 29:11.195
so she is the only one getting special treatment.

479
29:12.865 --> 29:14.395
Do not mess with Hong Du.

480
29:14.465 --> 29:16.805
She gives her heart away too easily, you know?

481
29:16.865 --> 29:19.135
She cries easily and laughs easily.

482
29:19.205 --> 29:20.335
It makes me feel bad for her.

483
29:26.215 --> 29:29.885
Why do you feel bad for her? I am the most pitiful one,

484
29:29.945 --> 29:32.015
getting extorted by my mom every single day.

485
29:32.085 --> 29:33.785
Wait a minute,

486
29:33.855 --> 29:35.625
does that mean...

487
29:35.685 --> 29:38.325
Um Tae Bong's house is empty right now?

488
29:45.595 --> 29:47.395
Move the bottom part up this way a little.

489
29:48.565 --> 29:51.835
Come to think of it, that jerk's name was Han Jung Woo, too.

490
29:51.905 --> 29:53.675
Why is that name so common?

491
29:54.945 --> 29:57.175
It is almost as if the Han Jung Woo from that drama...

492
29:57.245 --> 29:59.845
was modeled after him.

493
30:02.385 --> 30:03.585
He basically toyed with you.

494
30:09.225 --> 30:10.285
(BK001 Limited Edition Buyers' Private Party Proposal)

495
30:12.025 --> 30:13.455
After the commercial shoot,

496
30:13.525 --> 30:16.365
we plan to host a private party exclusively for buyers of...

497
30:16.425 --> 30:18.195
the new car's limited edition.

498
30:18.265 --> 30:21.065
A charity auction is also included in the event.

499
30:21.135 --> 30:24.135
- A charity auction? - All the collected donations...

500
30:24.205 --> 30:26.035
will be delivered to an international relief organization.

501
30:27.405 --> 30:28.905
So my job there is...

502
30:28.975 --> 30:30.605
rather than how to make a lot of money,

503
30:30.675 --> 30:33.445
to stand in front of rich people who worry about where to spend it,

504
30:33.515 --> 30:35.185
listen to speeches about the changing global situation...

505
30:35.245 --> 30:38.355
and unstable overseas stock markets, for a couple of hours,

506
30:38.415 --> 30:39.885
agree with their gossip about the hottest celebrities...

507
30:39.955 --> 30:43.025
to get on their good side, and basically...

508
30:43.085 --> 30:47.025
be the pretty face that rakes in the money?

509
30:50.595 --> 30:51.795
Not quite.

510
30:51.865 --> 30:54.065
I was asking you to make a donation yourself.

511
30:55.335 --> 30:57.975
- A talent donation. - A what donation?

512
30:58.035 --> 31:00.905
When they only want to open one pocket,

513
31:00.975 --> 31:03.045
I want you to use your magic...

514
31:03.105 --> 31:05.375
- to make them open both. - Magic?

515
31:05.445 --> 31:08.245
I would like to auction off a dinner with Um Tae Bong.

516
31:08.315 --> 31:11.615
You are putting a price tag on a dinner with me.

517
31:11.685 --> 31:14.285
However, it seems you have run into one small problem recently.

518
31:14.355 --> 31:16.755
The incident where you left the set the other day.

519
31:16.825 --> 31:18.195
Because of that, the issue of Actor Um's...

520
31:18.255 --> 31:21.625
arrogant personality has surfaced again.

521
31:23.195 --> 31:26.165
You have many devoted fans, but you also have many haters,

522
31:26.235 --> 31:28.005
so we are deeply concerned that...

523
31:28.065 --> 31:29.205
it might cause some noise at this event...

524
31:31.165 --> 31:33.475
Na Hoon A, the godfather of the entertainment industry,

525
31:33.535 --> 31:35.275
once said this.

526
31:35.275 --> 31:37.745
A true superstar...

527
31:37.805 --> 31:41.785
must drive both their fans and their haters...

528
31:41.845 --> 31:46.615
crazy at the same time. A star who only has devoted fans...

529
31:48.055 --> 31:49.955
has no charm.

530
31:56.525 --> 32:00.795
- Why look at me like that? - Between a fan and a hater,

531
32:02.005 --> 32:04.905
I was wondering which line I should stand in...

532
32:05.905 --> 32:07.405
for Um Tae Bong.

533
32:08.575 --> 32:10.305
Unbelievable.

534
32:10.375 --> 32:12.075
I will take responsibility for that.

535
32:12.145 --> 32:13.145
Right.

536
32:20.715 --> 32:21.725
Please sign here...

537
32:23.785 --> 32:27.655
- I have not made a decision yet. - That cautiousness,

538
32:27.725 --> 32:29.195
the more I see it, the more it is my style.

539
32:32.395 --> 32:34.495
I just hope our taste in women does not overlap.

540
32:36.205 --> 32:39.275
That will never happen.

541
32:39.335 --> 32:43.175
Because my standards are incredibly high.

542
32:51.485 --> 32:53.085
Where did it go?

543
32:53.155 --> 32:55.955
If they do not overlap, that is a relief for me.

544
32:58.395 --> 32:59.455
Excuse me for a moment.

545
33:01.995 --> 33:03.125
(Cha Hong Du)

546
33:05.735 --> 33:07.035
Yes, what is it?

547
33:07.095 --> 33:11.105
I am in a taxi on my way to you,

548
33:11.165 --> 33:15.005
and I think I left my motion sickness pills at home.

549
33:15.075 --> 33:16.405
What?

550
33:16.475 --> 33:18.945
I really cannot breathe.

551
33:19.015 --> 33:21.615
Um Tae Bong, help me.

552
33:23.515 --> 33:24.515
Wait.

553
33:30.685 --> 33:32.195
Excuse me, by any chance,

554
33:33.825 --> 33:35.425
is there an empty room...

555
33:36.425 --> 33:37.865
I can use?

556
33:41.365 --> 33:45.105
Tears are welling up so I lift my head

557
33:45.175 --> 33:48.545
And smile a little more so they do not fall

558
33:48.605 --> 33:52.375
Why are you doing this to me what are you saying

559
33:52.445 --> 33:56.345
All the words you said today up to the sky

560
33:56.415 --> 33:59.185
- The words I could never say - He is singing?

561
34:00.485 --> 34:04.655
The words I did not know I would say while crying

562
34:04.725 --> 34:08.725
I like you

563
34:08.795 --> 34:12.495
So much

564
34:12.565 --> 34:15.305
Oh my, one, two!

565
34:15.365 --> 34:18.675
I am in my dream

566
34:22.775 --> 34:24.275
Oh, man.

567
34:25.415 --> 34:27.045
This is not singing, it sounds like a pig being...

568
34:27.115 --> 34:30.085
Anyway, he has been doing that for 15 minutes already.

569
34:30.145 --> 34:32.315
Why on earth? Did he suddenly go crazy?

570
34:32.385 --> 34:33.885
I mean, why do this in someone else's company?

571
34:33.955 --> 34:35.785
Why? It sounds good to me.

572
34:36.985 --> 34:38.195
That does?

573
34:38.255 --> 34:40.495
He must have received a mission from his girlfriend.

574
34:40.555 --> 34:42.465
I heard he was caught up in dating rumors, too.

575
34:42.525 --> 34:44.125
Um Tae Bong...

576
34:44.195 --> 34:46.065
seems to be more romantic than I thought.

577
34:48.435 --> 34:50.205
You do not have to sing anymore.

578
34:50.265 --> 34:51.905
I have arrived, where should I go?

579
34:53.105 --> 34:55.375
- Yes, Chairman. - Where are you right now?

580
34:55.445 --> 34:57.045
I am still at the office.

581
34:57.105 --> 34:59.375
That neighborhood where Hae Ra was caught on CCTV,

582
34:59.445 --> 35:01.045
I would like you to go there yourself.

583
35:02.145 --> 35:03.745
I have already checked everything there...

584
35:08.985 --> 35:13.725
- How is Ms. Hae Ra here... - Did you just say Hae Ra?

585
35:14.725 --> 35:16.165
Excuse me?

586
35:16.225 --> 35:17.895
No, I did not.

587
35:17.965 --> 35:20.065
- Where are you right now, Chairman? - I am in the lobby.

588
35:36.385 --> 35:37.915
Chairman, I will come escort you.

589
36:02.705 --> 36:04.745
Why is everyone here?

590
36:07.245 --> 36:09.715
Oh, here.

591
36:09.785 --> 36:12.085
My stylist is here.

592
36:12.155 --> 36:13.155
Hong Du.

593
36:15.685 --> 36:17.255
What?

594
36:17.325 --> 36:18.655
Jung Woo?

595
36:18.725 --> 36:20.025
So you are...

596
36:26.935 --> 36:29.805
Um Tae Bong's secret bodyguard.

597
36:29.865 --> 36:32.375
What? The number of people who know that...

598
36:32.435 --> 36:33.435
just increased by one a second ago...

599
36:33.505 --> 36:34.945
So that secret of yours...

600
36:35.005 --> 36:37.675
will not be able to complete its mission anymore?

601
36:41.115 --> 36:43.185
I am sorry, I did not mean to intrude.

602
36:43.245 --> 36:44.745
Anyway, I will also participate...

603
36:44.815 --> 36:47.755
- in keeping this secret. - Wow. Do whatever you want.

604
36:47.815 --> 36:49.325
This is surprising.

605
36:49.385 --> 36:50.725
To think you two are connected like this...

606
36:53.995 --> 36:55.125
Oh, then...

607
36:55.195 --> 36:57.925
The employer I talked to on the phone back then...

608
37:05.175 --> 37:08.505
The one who broadcasted her washing up live...

609
37:09.745 --> 37:11.505
Him?

610
37:11.575 --> 37:14.875
Wait, you two know each other too?

611
37:14.945 --> 37:16.915
- How? - Then are you two...

612
37:16.985 --> 37:19.655
- still living in the same house? - Oh, not just the two of us,

613
37:19.715 --> 37:21.885
but three of us including my father...

614
37:21.955 --> 37:24.455
So you two lived in the rooftop room?

615
37:24.525 --> 37:26.025
As very close...

616
37:26.095 --> 37:27.755
neighbors?

617
37:27.825 --> 37:29.525
Oh, what about it?

618
37:29.595 --> 37:32.435
But what kind of danger are you guarding him from?

619
37:34.165 --> 37:35.765
It does not look like there is anything dangerous.

620
37:37.265 --> 37:40.105
Oh, well, well, what kind of danger it is...

621
37:40.175 --> 37:41.435
It is a bit...

622
37:41.505 --> 37:42.945
This is too dangerous.

623
37:43.005 --> 37:44.505
I almost burned the roof of my mouth earlier.

624
37:51.415 --> 37:53.055
This is also too dangerous.

625
37:53.115 --> 37:55.325
- I almost cut my finger and bled. - Oh, really?

626
37:58.825 --> 37:59.895
Knock it off.

627
38:04.765 --> 38:05.995
Anyway,

628
38:06.635 --> 38:07.695
did you know?

629
38:07.765 --> 38:10.605
My house is smaller than other celebrities' houses.

630
38:10.665 --> 38:14.375
Especially since the walls are so thin,

631
38:14.435 --> 38:17.745
you can hear everything from coughing to farting.

632
38:17.745 --> 38:20.345
Sometimes, how should I put it?

633
38:25.215 --> 38:28.825
It feels like we are sleeping in the same room.

634
38:32.455 --> 38:34.495
- Excuse me, Hong Du. - Yes?

635
38:34.555 --> 38:35.895
Do you happen to need earplugs?

636
38:37.525 --> 38:39.165
Are you worrying about me right now?

637
38:42.865 --> 38:45.135
The point of what I am saying is not that.

638
38:45.205 --> 38:46.405
Seriously, man.

639
38:47.435 --> 38:51.745
Are you the type who cannot understand what people are saying?

640
38:51.815 --> 38:55.085
- I mean, this woman and I... - I am sorry.

641
38:55.145 --> 38:57.845
It has only been a few days since I came from abroad.

642
38:57.915 --> 39:00.485
Do you not know that you are beating around the bush?

643
39:01.925 --> 39:04.355
Whose side are you on?

644
39:05.025 --> 39:06.795
Stay outside.

645
39:06.855 --> 39:08.725
- What did you say? - Stay outside.

646
39:18.505 --> 39:20.075
How is it?

647
39:20.135 --> 39:21.305
Can you tell it is me?

648
39:22.575 --> 39:23.575
With you all covered up like that,

649
39:23.645 --> 39:25.245
how could anyone tell you are Song Na Ri?

650
39:25.315 --> 39:26.375
It is fine.

651
39:26.445 --> 39:28.745
Oh, you really do not know anything.

652
39:30.245 --> 39:33.285
Do you not see all those people staring?

653
39:38.425 --> 39:40.055
You saw them, right?

654
39:40.125 --> 39:41.995
Why do you think celebrities insist on wearing...

655
39:42.065 --> 39:45.095
such huge sunglasses even in the dead of night?

656
39:45.165 --> 39:46.765
Do you think they actually want to hide?

657
39:46.835 --> 39:48.265
Well, no.

658
39:48.335 --> 39:51.875
It is actually their way of saying, "I am a celebrity."

659
39:51.935 --> 39:53.435
They are advertising themselves.

660
39:53.505 --> 39:55.345
That is why people call them attention seekers.

661
39:55.405 --> 39:58.645
What's wrong with seeking it? Malicious commenters are worse.

662
40:00.275 --> 40:01.815
Anyway, what are you suddenly trying to buy?

663
40:03.115 --> 40:04.545
It is a secret.

664
40:04.615 --> 40:06.585
Yes, I am Song Na Ri.

665
40:14.755 --> 40:16.065
That is a shame.

666
40:16.125 --> 40:17.565
I can only hope you change your mind.

667
40:18.865 --> 40:20.965
That is not going to happen.

668
40:21.035 --> 40:22.605
So you are saying you will not do it...

669
40:26.005 --> 40:29.545
Our company even sponsored your drama before.

670
40:29.605 --> 40:31.045
You know the one.

671
40:31.105 --> 40:33.445
- The Crown Prince's... - Oh my gosh.

672
40:34.615 --> 40:38.485
Right, BK was the sponsor back then, and we filmed here too.

673
40:38.555 --> 40:40.315
Then according to her delusion,

674
40:40.385 --> 40:41.925
I am supposed to be the heir to this company.

675
40:41.985 --> 40:42.985
Are you done?

676
40:43.055 --> 40:44.655
Oh, right, this is your company, is it not?

677
40:44.725 --> 40:45.725
Excuse me?

678
40:47.295 --> 40:48.295
Did you not know?

679
40:48.355 --> 40:51.325
- Um Tae Bong here is the ow... - The owner, yes.

680
40:52.935 --> 40:54.635
What I mean is...

681
40:54.695 --> 40:57.035
I have a very strong sense of ownership,

682
40:57.105 --> 40:59.305
and the model is essentially the owner of the brand.

683
40:59.375 --> 41:03.805
I will do it. I will do that talent donation.

684
41:06.875 --> 41:09.745
You changed your mind so quickly. Anyway, that is great news.

685
41:10.785 --> 41:12.215
He keeps flipping back and forth.

686
41:12.285 --> 41:16.255
- Acting like he is the owner. - Come on. This guy right here...

687
41:16.325 --> 41:21.755
- is the chairman's son. - The flower of our company.

688
41:21.825 --> 41:25.565
An eternal flame that never goes out.

689
41:25.635 --> 41:28.265
- You mean me? - Yes.

690
41:28.335 --> 41:31.435
I neglected the company a lot since entering entertainment,

691
41:31.505 --> 41:34.005
but having someone as excellent as you, Mr. Na,

692
41:34.075 --> 41:37.445
takes a huge weight off my shoulders.

693
41:37.505 --> 41:40.175
You will keep up the hard work, right?

694
41:40.245 --> 41:41.245
Excuse me?

695
41:43.815 --> 41:45.485
- Yes. - Right.

696
41:45.815 --> 41:47.485
Are you not coming?

697
41:47.555 --> 41:48.685
Oh, hold on.

698
41:48.755 --> 41:50.955
Jung Woo, let us go ride bicycles again this weekend.

699
41:51.025 --> 41:52.595
Um Tae Bong does not have any schedules that day.

700
41:52.655 --> 41:54.255
Unbelievable.

701
41:54.325 --> 41:56.665
- What is with her pronunciation? - Shall we?

702
41:56.725 --> 41:58.735
There are so many other things besides cycling...

703
41:58.795 --> 42:00.565
that I want to teach you, Hong Du.

704
42:00.635 --> 42:03.165
Really? I would love that.

705
42:03.235 --> 42:04.635
Unbelievable.

706
42:04.705 --> 42:06.575
Look at them making heart eyes at each other.

707
42:06.635 --> 42:09.845
- Are you coming or not? - What? I am coming.

708
42:09.905 --> 42:10.905
I will get going now.

709
42:13.645 --> 42:15.545
They seem closer than just colleagues, right?

710
42:16.785 --> 42:19.085
I heard celebrities often disguise their lovers as a stylist...

711
42:19.155 --> 42:21.155
or a manager to fool people.

712
42:21.215 --> 42:23.585
Do you think the person who sang earlier...

713
42:23.655 --> 42:26.095
might have been her? I just have a strong feeling.

714
42:27.395 --> 42:30.165
Wow, a heart.

715
42:30.225 --> 42:31.795
Manager Na.

716
42:31.865 --> 42:33.165
You said you were the spark of our company, right?

717
42:35.605 --> 42:37.035
Let us see you burn that spark today.

718
42:38.805 --> 42:40.035
All right, our team is working overtime today.

719
42:42.405 --> 42:44.005
Who gave you permission to make plans?

720
42:45.045 --> 42:47.215
You probably have a schedule that day.

721
42:47.275 --> 42:49.145
Wow, that is so petty.

722
42:49.215 --> 42:51.545
I already checked, and I have nothing scheduled that day.

723
42:51.615 --> 42:52.815
Then what about your father?

724
42:52.885 --> 42:56.155
You were so desperate to find him, gosh.

725
42:56.225 --> 42:58.695
Then I can just bring my father along.

726
42:58.755 --> 43:00.055
No, what I mean is...

727
43:02.065 --> 43:04.565
Anyway, because of you today,

728
43:04.625 --> 43:08.935
- I even had to sing, - Oh, I am sorry about that.

729
43:09.005 --> 43:11.865
And you promised a talent donation that I did not even have to do.

730
43:11.935 --> 43:13.875
It is for your company, so why is that my fault?

731
43:13.935 --> 43:15.575
It is your fault, entirely your fault.

732
43:16.675 --> 43:21.245
Well, it is for my company, but business is a separate matter.

733
43:21.315 --> 43:22.985
If you had not come here and hyped it up,

734
43:23.045 --> 43:24.485
I would not have done it for free.

735
43:24.545 --> 43:26.315
If I make decisions without consulting him,

736
43:26.385 --> 43:28.755
what position does that put CEO Park in?

737
43:28.825 --> 43:30.155
Oh, is that so?

738
43:31.485 --> 43:32.495
Sorry.

739
43:36.125 --> 43:37.565
Oh, I will be right back after a quick phone call.

740
43:37.625 --> 43:38.625
Okay.

741
43:54.245 --> 43:55.585
I grabbed it first.

742
43:56.745 --> 44:00.515
I was exactly 0.1 seconds faster. From the moment I walked in,

743
44:00.585 --> 44:02.285
I already had my eyes on this outfit.

744
44:04.825 --> 44:06.355
Excuse me, maybe you do not know...

745
44:06.425 --> 44:09.225
- who I am... - I know you, Song Na Ri.

746
44:09.295 --> 44:10.295
Well...

747
44:11.295 --> 44:14.435
You know me? Wait, even though you know me...

748
44:15.805 --> 44:18.605
Expecting celebrity privileges in a place like this...

749
44:18.665 --> 44:20.505
makes you look a bit cheap, does it not?

750
44:20.575 --> 44:23.775
Excuse me, who asked for celebrity privileges?

751
44:23.845 --> 44:27.345
You might not know this, but the hand is quicker than the eye.

752
44:27.415 --> 44:28.645
My really close friend, Cho Seung Woo,

753
44:28.715 --> 44:29.715
said that in a movie.

754
44:32.185 --> 44:34.415
I do not know about that line,

755
44:34.485 --> 44:36.855
but I do remember a famous line that Kim Hye Soo said in it.

756
44:38.455 --> 44:41.155
Look at this kid talking back. So disrespectful.

757
44:42.695 --> 44:44.295
What? Disrespectful?

758
44:47.665 --> 44:49.605
I have heard that insult as often as I eat meals,

759
44:49.665 --> 44:51.235
so it does not really work on me.

760
44:53.805 --> 44:56.405
- Excuse me. - Yes.

761
44:56.475 --> 44:58.075
Please check the video replay for us.

762
44:59.215 --> 45:00.215
We do not install video replay systems...

763
45:00.275 --> 45:02.585
just to prepare for situations like this.

764
45:02.645 --> 45:04.445
Why do you not just have one of you yield...

765
45:06.285 --> 45:11.025
You grabbed the sleeve of the shirt. I grabbed the body of the shirt.

766
45:12.855 --> 45:15.325
Then there is really only one way to settle this.

767
45:15.395 --> 45:16.465
Please...

768
45:16.525 --> 45:17.565
- cut it in half. - Cut it in half.

769
45:24.835 --> 45:26.205
I'm the one who stayed up for three nights straight,

770
45:26.275 --> 45:27.605
so why are you the one in a bad mood?

771
45:28.675 --> 45:31.045
I just got into a fight.

772
45:31.105 --> 45:33.545
- With some cheeky little brat. - Cheeky?

773
45:33.615 --> 45:36.745
That's your area of expertise. Who dared to?

774
45:36.815 --> 45:40.285
Oh my, my inner voice was pretty loud, wasn't it?

775
45:40.355 --> 45:43.755
Anyway, who is this girl? The warrior who went toe-to-toe.

776
45:43.825 --> 45:45.655
There's this girl. A really stupid one.

777
45:47.055 --> 45:48.395
I mean, I called dibs on it first,

778
45:48.455 --> 45:50.595
but she insisted she picked it first.

779
45:50.665 --> 45:51.995
Gosh, unbelievable.

780
45:52.065 --> 45:54.365
Do you know how long I've had my eye on that?

781
45:57.005 --> 45:58.975
Are you seeing someone?

782
46:00.075 --> 46:03.605
My gut says it's been a while since you met him,

783
46:03.675 --> 46:06.245
but you haven't made it to the dating stage yet.

784
46:07.815 --> 46:08.815
What are you talking about?

785
46:09.845 --> 46:12.255
Writing is all about observing people.

786
46:12.315 --> 46:13.955
You should try this job. You'd be a psychic.

787
46:15.355 --> 46:17.725
Then you should roll that mat right back up.

788
46:17.785 --> 46:18.955
It's not a man.

789
46:19.025 --> 46:20.655
Gosh, so what if it is?

790
46:20.725 --> 46:22.825
It's been three years since you let Min Seok go.

791
46:22.895 --> 46:26.495
Well, it's a shame it's not.

792
46:26.565 --> 46:29.335
The only time a person should be alone is in their coffin.

793
46:29.405 --> 46:32.105
Look at Song Na Ri. She did my drama,

794
46:32.175 --> 46:34.835
started dating Um Tae Bong, and now her eyes are just sparkling.

795
46:34.905 --> 46:36.505
Oh, you'd know Um Tae Bong better than me.

796
46:36.575 --> 46:38.345
He's been playing around with so many girls,

797
46:38.405 --> 46:41.345
so is Um Tae Bong finally settling down now?

798
46:46.385 --> 46:48.685
I heard you set a wedding date. With a doctor?

799
46:48.755 --> 46:50.885
I should bow down to Um Tae Bong.

800
46:50.955 --> 46:52.655
I mean, honestly, six months ago,

801
46:52.725 --> 46:54.455
after your dating scandal with Um Tae Bong broke,

802
46:54.525 --> 46:56.825
you got back in the spotlight and snagged a doctor.

803
46:56.895 --> 46:58.065
Bow down, my foot...

804
46:58.125 --> 47:01.165
- It was strictly business anyway. - What?

805
47:01.235 --> 47:03.035
Actually, we were fake back then.

806
47:04.035 --> 47:06.275
Oh my, so that tabloid rumor was true?

807
47:06.335 --> 47:09.305
Not just me, but all the female celebrities Um Tae Bong dated...

808
47:09.375 --> 47:10.845
were all business relationships.

809
47:10.905 --> 47:12.575
I heard the one he's seeing now, Song Na Ri, is real.

810
47:12.645 --> 47:14.345
She's fake too, 100 percent.

811
47:14.415 --> 47:17.415
Hey, is it okay to just blab about this?

812
47:17.485 --> 47:19.585
Why should I care about that guy now?

813
47:19.655 --> 47:21.555
Whether rumors spread or not.

814
47:21.615 --> 47:22.855
Let's go.

815
47:22.925 --> 47:23.925
Let's go.

816
47:29.525 --> 47:31.465
- Hey. - Yes.

817
47:31.525 --> 47:33.095
Let's do dinner next time.

818
47:33.165 --> 47:34.695
I think something urgent just came up.

819
47:37.405 --> 47:39.935
Hey, oh, man.

820
47:40.005 --> 47:42.005
I...

821
47:43.275 --> 47:45.775
I can't sing anymore. Seriously,

822
47:45.845 --> 47:47.575
I'm going to get vocal cord nodules, seriously.

823
47:48.775 --> 47:50.915
Your motion sickness should be fine for a bit.

824
47:50.985 --> 47:52.785
So rest your voice for a while.

825
47:52.855 --> 47:56.225
Yes, yes, thank you.

826
47:56.285 --> 48:00.225
Man, seriously, you really don't listen.

827
48:00.295 --> 48:02.865
It wasn't even dangerous earlier, but you just had to come.

828
48:02.925 --> 48:05.595
Well, I'm the person who protects you...

829
48:05.665 --> 48:06.795
anytime, anywhere.

830
48:07.795 --> 48:09.635
And yet you left the motion sickness pills behind?

831
48:09.705 --> 48:13.075
That is so Hong Du.

832
48:16.005 --> 48:18.645
So Hong Du. You do not know what it means?

833
48:18.705 --> 48:20.645
- I do not. - What about "a great value?"

834
48:21.945 --> 48:24.115
How can you not know such an old catchphrase?

835
48:24.185 --> 48:26.415
When someone is generous like Kim Hye Ja...

836
48:26.485 --> 48:29.585
and it is highly cost-effective, it is a great value.

837
48:29.655 --> 48:32.395
Then what do you think "so Hong Du" means?

838
48:32.455 --> 48:33.455
Somehow,

839
48:34.555 --> 48:37.495
I feel like I am about to get very offended.

840
48:37.565 --> 48:39.735
Oh, you are weak with catchphrases,

841
48:39.795 --> 48:42.835
but your intuition is quite something.

842
48:42.905 --> 48:43.905
Gosh.

843
48:46.475 --> 48:47.475
But...

844
48:48.775 --> 48:51.175
how long are you planning to be my bodyguard?

845
48:54.615 --> 48:57.615
Until I feel that you are completely safe?

846
49:01.185 --> 49:04.125
Why do you ask all of a sudden?

847
49:09.525 --> 49:11.365
Song Na Ri posted on her social media.

848
49:11.425 --> 49:12.695
Take care of that first, quickly.

849
49:18.735 --> 49:20.435
Today is Tae Bong's real birthday.

850
49:20.505 --> 49:22.705
I wonder what face he will make when he sees the gift.

851
49:22.775 --> 49:24.605
I am so excited.

852
49:27.375 --> 49:29.215
I will drop you off at the subway station.

853
49:29.285 --> 49:30.415
You do not get subway sickness, right?

854
49:31.585 --> 49:34.085
Here, open it.

855
49:41.455 --> 49:42.465
What is it?

856
49:43.965 --> 49:47.995
What? Are these arm sleeves?

857
49:48.065 --> 49:50.305
My birthday gift prepared just for you.

858
49:50.365 --> 49:52.735
You could call it spoils of war from a fierce battle.

859
49:54.075 --> 49:56.445
Did someone die? Spoils of war.

860
49:56.505 --> 49:58.745
If you are going to give it to me, give me both.

861
49:58.805 --> 50:01.875
- What is with just one side? - It is our couple item.

862
50:01.945 --> 50:03.945
Wear it on your left arm when you drive in the summer.

863
50:04.015 --> 50:06.715
Because your arm is precious. Just like my hair.

864
50:08.255 --> 50:09.285
Oh, wait.

865
50:09.355 --> 50:11.625
Let's just take a picture to post on social media.

866
50:11.685 --> 50:13.625
I absolutely hate taking pictures.

867
50:13.695 --> 50:15.525
- I am not taking one, never. - Here, one, two, three.

868
50:17.695 --> 50:19.065
Oh my, it came out well.

869
50:19.135 --> 50:21.295
He said he would not take it, but his words...

870
50:21.365 --> 50:25.305
and actions are so different. That is so Tae Bong.

871
50:30.575 --> 50:32.175
Did I hear that wrong?

872
50:32.245 --> 50:33.845
I think someone was badmouthing you.

873
50:33.915 --> 50:35.785
Yes, you heard wrong.

874
50:39.615 --> 50:41.055
Anyway, I think the dating rumors with you...

875
50:41.115 --> 50:44.655
broke out at a good time. Since when do you think I liked you?

876
50:47.125 --> 50:49.295
Is this a quiz? What is the prize money?

877
50:49.365 --> 50:52.995
I never answer unless it is deposited into my bank account.

878
50:56.565 --> 50:58.905
Yes, your script is always so tattered.

879
50:58.965 --> 50:59.975
But...

880
51:02.235 --> 51:04.545
never let your heart get tattered.

881
51:05.575 --> 51:06.815
Since the moment you said that.

882
51:08.915 --> 51:11.015
I said that? Then I take it back.

883
51:11.085 --> 51:14.215
From now on, you need to get more tattered.

884
51:14.285 --> 51:17.225
Your mentality is on the level of Iron Man's armor.

885
51:17.285 --> 51:19.595
His mentality is even stronger.

886
51:19.655 --> 51:23.295
He gets angry all day, yet he still eats just fine.

887
51:23.365 --> 51:25.935
That is so Tae Bong.

888
51:27.565 --> 51:29.235
Oh, that fakeness, that is also so Tae Bong.

889
51:29.305 --> 51:30.735
Just so Tae Bong.

890
51:30.805 --> 51:33.775
Would you like to order, ma'am?

891
51:33.835 --> 51:35.605
Well, I...

892
51:35.675 --> 51:36.675
I mean...

893
51:38.305 --> 51:40.315
(180 Dollars)

894
51:41.315 --> 51:45.815
What's the cheapest thing you have here?

895
51:45.885 --> 51:47.215
Under ten dollars.

896
51:47.285 --> 51:48.955
Excuse me?

897
51:49.015 --> 51:50.925
Why did she follow me all the way here...

898
51:50.985 --> 51:52.185
I'm never going to pay for her.

899
51:58.095 --> 51:59.965
Oh, why does it feel like there are three of us...

900
52:00.035 --> 52:01.995
instead of two?

901
52:02.065 --> 52:03.835
I'm a huge fan.

902
52:03.905 --> 52:04.905
You're so pretty.

903
52:05.935 --> 52:07.435
I'll take your card, thank you.

904
52:07.435 --> 52:09.005
Hey, do you have 40 dollars?

905
52:09.075 --> 52:11.075
What restaurant charges over 50 dollars for the cheapest thing?

906
52:11.145 --> 52:12.745
Exactly. Why are you eating at a place like this...

907
52:12.815 --> 52:14.545
when you don't even have money?

908
52:14.615 --> 52:16.515
I thought I was going to die following you in a taxi...

909
52:16.585 --> 52:18.015
without motion sickness medicine.

910
52:18.085 --> 52:19.615
You think I wanted to come? I came...

911
52:21.385 --> 52:22.525
to protect you.

912
52:22.585 --> 52:24.685
Why don't you just announce it to the world?

913
52:24.755 --> 52:28.725
It wouldn't be weird at all if Song Na Ri saw you here.

914
52:28.795 --> 52:30.525
That's why I covered myself up.

915
52:33.035 --> 52:37.435
Only follow me when I say I need a bodyguard.

916
52:37.505 --> 52:39.165
Stop getting in my way.

917
52:40.405 --> 52:41.405
Getting in your way?

918
52:47.615 --> 52:50.815
Goodbye. Tae Bong.

919
52:50.885 --> 52:51.885
Let's go together.

920
52:56.885 --> 52:58.785
Well...

921
52:58.855 --> 53:02.495
I'm so sorry, but I don't have enough money.

922
53:02.565 --> 53:04.495
Is there any way I can pay it off with manual labor?

923
53:04.565 --> 53:07.435
Like washing dishes or something?

924
53:07.495 --> 53:09.765
The gentleman who just left paid for it.

925
53:09.835 --> 53:10.835
What?

926
53:15.335 --> 53:18.305
- The car is here. - Oh, your car is here.

927
53:18.375 --> 53:21.375
So where should we go now? My place?

928
53:21.445 --> 53:23.045
Or yours?

929
53:23.115 --> 53:27.015
Gosh, oh my.

930
53:28.815 --> 53:30.155
Hold on a second.

931
53:30.225 --> 53:31.385
(Hyun Joo)

932
53:32.755 --> 53:33.755
Yes.

933
53:35.195 --> 53:36.295
What?

934
53:36.925 --> 53:38.195
Stay right there and wait.

935
53:40.935 --> 53:41.935
Tae Bong.

936
53:43.265 --> 53:46.205
Should I get in? Can I get in?

937
53:46.275 --> 53:47.275
Hey.

938
53:48.335 --> 53:49.345
I asked if I should get in.

939
53:49.405 --> 53:50.975
Don't pretend you can't hear me. Hey.

940
53:52.575 --> 53:53.815
Hey. Um Tae Bong!

941
54:04.955 --> 54:05.955
Excuse me.

942
54:12.065 --> 54:13.795
Are you her guardian?

943
54:13.865 --> 54:15.495
I mean, she almost hit someone,

944
54:15.565 --> 54:17.835
but she's just sitting in her car not moving.

945
54:17.905 --> 54:19.975
What? Aren't you...

946
54:20.035 --> 54:21.035
Oh, yes.

947
54:21.105 --> 54:22.175
I'll take care of the medical bills...

948
54:22.235 --> 54:24.945
- and compensation for damages. - Oh, okay.

949
54:25.105 --> 54:27.175
- If you could wait over there... - Oh, okay.

950
54:38.925 --> 54:41.095
- Tae Bong. - Are you okay?

951
54:47.295 --> 54:48.695
Have you calmed down a bit?

952
54:49.835 --> 54:51.335
Wait, where's Dong Seok?

953
54:51.405 --> 54:53.705
Oh, Dong Seok...

954
54:53.775 --> 54:55.735
I am sorry.

955
54:55.805 --> 54:57.445
I was just so shocked earlier.

956
54:58.605 --> 55:00.215
Like a fool, you were the only one I could think of.

957
55:01.545 --> 55:03.685
I guess it was worse because of Min Seok.

958
55:03.745 --> 55:06.485
Seeing someone get hit by a car, and by my car, of all things.

959
55:08.385 --> 55:10.425
It was so, so scary.

960
55:11.955 --> 55:14.995
He was not hurt anywhere. He says he is fine.

961
55:15.055 --> 55:16.065
Really?

962
55:17.395 --> 55:18.395
That is a relief.

963
55:19.565 --> 55:21.095
If it were not for you...

964
55:21.165 --> 55:23.165
I would still be crying right now.

965
55:26.875 --> 55:29.645
It was like that back then, too. The day we first met.

966
55:30.845 --> 55:33.215
I had an accident and was having a mental breakdown that day, too,

967
55:33.275 --> 55:35.745
but you suddenly appeared and helped me.

968
55:35.815 --> 55:36.815
Do you remember?

969
55:41.115 --> 55:42.255
Oh, my neck.

970
55:43.755 --> 55:45.385
What is this?

971
55:45.455 --> 55:47.895
Wow, the back of the car is completely ruined. Oh, seriously.

972
55:47.955 --> 55:50.165
Hey, Miss, what are you going to do about this?

973
55:50.225 --> 55:52.625
I asked what you are going to do.

974
55:52.695 --> 55:56.635
Hey, Miss. You have to fix this.

975
55:56.705 --> 55:58.165
- Sir. - Yes, who are you?

976
55:58.235 --> 55:59.935
I am sorry, please wait a moment.

977
56:00.005 --> 56:01.005
Yes.

978
56:06.215 --> 56:09.345
It is going to be fine.

979
56:09.415 --> 56:11.345
Shall I help you a bit?

980
56:12.545 --> 56:15.985
Yes, thank you. What do I do?

981
56:17.955 --> 56:19.555
How could I forget?

982
56:19.625 --> 56:21.495
You were wearing a yellow dress just like now,

983
56:21.555 --> 56:24.025
looking exactly like a scared little chick.

984
56:24.095 --> 56:25.095
Did I?

985
56:26.365 --> 56:27.835
How do you remember all of that?

986
56:31.135 --> 56:33.035
We had a lot of fun back then.

987
56:35.375 --> 56:39.405
We did. With Min Seok and Dong Seok,

988
56:39.475 --> 56:42.475
the four of us used to roam all over Itaewon every day.

989
56:43.485 --> 56:44.485
Right.

990
56:46.815 --> 56:49.585
When Min Seok confessed his feelings to me,

991
56:49.655 --> 56:51.725
I was a little surprised.

992
56:51.785 --> 56:53.595
I thought you were going to confess.

993
56:59.665 --> 57:00.835
I suppose.

994
57:00.895 --> 57:03.505
Dong Seok would be more reliable as a bodyguard.

995
57:04.865 --> 57:07.175
I guess Um Tae Bong does not need me anymore.

996
57:12.445 --> 57:14.075
Just someone in the way...

997
57:31.195 --> 57:32.895
Hello.

998
57:32.965 --> 57:34.595
Being able to talk about things like this freely.

999
57:35.665 --> 57:37.265
I must have gotten really comfortable.

1000
57:43.145 --> 57:44.145
(Toxic Na Ri)

1001
57:45.675 --> 57:46.675
Wait a minute.

1002
57:49.445 --> 57:50.445
What is it?

1003
57:52.115 --> 57:53.755
Can you not even catch a taxi by yourself?

1004
57:54.755 --> 57:56.755
Just figure it out and get home safely.

1005
58:01.525 --> 58:02.525
Was that Song Na Ri?

1006
58:03.765 --> 58:04.765
Why?

1007
58:06.235 --> 58:07.235
It is nothing.

1008
58:08.865 --> 58:10.265
Why are you so in the way?

1009
58:10.335 --> 58:11.965
Stop that and go clean the second floor.

1010
58:12.035 --> 58:13.575
Yes, understood.

1011
58:25.885 --> 58:27.655
Why does she make me care so much?

1012
58:29.985 --> 58:31.425
Are you worried about Na Ri?

1013
58:32.585 --> 58:34.395
It is not like that.

1014
58:37.325 --> 58:38.325
It is raining.

1015
58:39.895 --> 58:40.895
Oh, it is.

1016
58:42.935 --> 58:44.235
The rain makes it so atmospheric.

1017
58:48.035 --> 58:51.675
It must be nice to be confessed to on a day like this, right?

1018
58:53.575 --> 58:55.145
She probably got back fine, right?

1019
58:55.215 --> 58:56.585
Actually,

1020
58:56.645 --> 58:59.345
I knew about it. Tae Bong, that you...

1021
59:00.415 --> 59:01.915
stepped aside for Min Seok.

1022
59:05.155 --> 59:06.795
Will she be okay without motion sickness medicine?

1023
59:10.265 --> 59:11.995
What?

1024
59:12.065 --> 59:13.635
Oh, hold on a second.

1025
59:20.835 --> 59:23.505
So...

1026
59:23.575 --> 59:25.875
Where I am right now is...

1027
59:25.945 --> 59:27.215
Well...

1028
59:30.085 --> 59:31.915
I don't know.

1029
59:31.985 --> 59:34.585
Just tell me any building you can see right now.

1030
59:34.655 --> 59:36.855
The place we ate at earlier was...

1031
59:36.925 --> 59:39.155
The Flat Table?

1032
59:39.225 --> 59:40.495
Yes, it was there.

1033
59:40.555 --> 59:41.755
Okay, stay right there and don't move.

1034
59:41.825 --> 59:42.855
I'll go there right now and...

1035
59:42.925 --> 59:44.225
Hello? Hello...

1036
59:45.765 --> 59:46.765
Mr. Han?

1037
59:50.335 --> 59:52.705
What, my battery is dead too.

1038
59:56.745 --> 59:58.575
Why am I being so Hong Du?

1039
01:00:01.675 --> 01:00:03.385
The person you are calling is unavailable,

1040
01:00:03.445 --> 01:00:05.015
and you are being connected to voicemail.

1041
01:00:08.885 --> 01:00:10.285
The phone is turned off.

1042
01:00:10.285 --> 01:00:13.125
After the beep, you will be connected to voicemail...

1043
01:00:14.425 --> 01:00:15.955
If you're worried about Song Na Ri...

1044
01:00:16.025 --> 01:00:17.765
I think I should get going.

1045
01:00:17.825 --> 01:00:19.665
We can talk later.

1046
01:00:19.735 --> 01:00:20.935
What? Tae Bong...

1047
01:00:31.575 --> 01:00:33.945
Unless she's a clueless idiot,

1048
01:00:33.945 --> 01:00:35.045
would she still be there?

1049
01:00:45.685 --> 01:00:46.695
Thank you.

1050
01:00:58.765 --> 01:01:02.035
Excuse me, which way is the subway station?

1051
01:01:02.105 --> 01:01:05.045
- There isn't one around here. - Oh, then to Hannam-dong,

1052
01:01:05.105 --> 01:01:06.575
how long would it take to walk?

1053
01:01:06.645 --> 01:01:09.545
What? You won't be able to walk, it's too far.

1054
01:01:09.615 --> 01:01:11.015
I see...

1055
01:01:11.085 --> 01:01:12.115
Thank you.

1056
01:01:57.095 --> 01:01:58.865
Are you really a clueless idiot?

1057
01:02:00.795 --> 01:02:02.595
Did you come looking for me?

1058
01:02:02.665 --> 01:02:05.265
- Why? - Because you're my bodyguard.

1059
01:02:07.005 --> 01:02:08.335
Don't leave my side.

1060
01:02:09.375 --> 01:02:10.375
I...

1061
01:02:12.705 --> 01:02:13.715
need you.

1062
01:02:22.515 --> 01:02:24.425
This might be a presumptuous question...

1063
01:02:25.825 --> 01:02:29.995
There's Hyun Bin or Kim Woo Bin, and many others,

1064
01:02:30.065 --> 01:02:32.325
so why did she specifically choose...

1065
01:02:32.395 --> 01:02:33.535
our Tae Bong?

1066
01:02:38.105 --> 01:02:39.165
That's probably because...

1067
01:02:41.505 --> 01:02:43.205
Are you watching?

1068
01:02:43.275 --> 01:02:44.305
Ghost?

1069
01:02:44.375 --> 01:02:47.675
You asked who said that back then, right?

1070
01:02:50.615 --> 01:02:53.215
No one had ever made the young lady smile...

1071
01:02:53.285 --> 01:02:55.185
until he did.

1072
01:02:58.185 --> 01:03:01.195
The person who is with the young lady right now...

1073
01:03:02.825 --> 01:03:04.625
It does not matter who it is.

1074
01:03:08.495 --> 01:03:09.835
Don't go anywhere anymore.

1075
01:03:12.165 --> 01:03:13.175
Just stay by my side.

1076
01:03:20.075 --> 01:03:21.815
Anyway, you're so clueless.

1077
01:03:22.815 --> 01:03:25.015
You're so...

1078
01:03:25.085 --> 01:03:26.185
Hong Du.

1079
01:03:27.585 --> 01:03:29.585
Didn't you say I was in your way earlier?

1080
01:03:29.655 --> 01:03:32.385
And you're being so Tae Bong.

1081
01:03:37.025 --> 01:03:38.025
It's raining a lot.

1082
01:03:40.835 --> 01:03:41.835
It is.

1083
01:03:45.865 --> 01:03:47.305
Let's go home.

1084
01:03:49.005 --> 01:03:50.405
Yes, let's go.

1085
01:03:53.515 --> 01:03:56.745
Oh my, that is so Hong Du, so Hong Du.

1086
01:03:56.815 --> 01:03:59.385
- Oh my, that is so Tae Bong, - And you are so Tae Bong.

1087
01:04:00.455 --> 01:04:02.315
Do you finally get...

1088
01:04:02.385 --> 01:04:04.325
what being Hong Du means?

1089
01:04:04.385 --> 01:04:07.295
- No, I do not know. - No, I think you do know.

1090
01:04:07.355 --> 01:04:08.355
No, I do not know.

1091
01:04:19.805 --> 01:04:23.475
The person who is with the young lady right now...

1092
01:04:23.545 --> 01:04:25.375
It does not matter who it is.

1093
01:04:26.615 --> 01:04:28.375
The one person she must never meet again.

1094
01:04:29.745 --> 01:04:31.315
As long as it is not that person.

1095
01:04:37.885 --> 01:04:40.695
(Oh! My Guard)
